srobroek.parley (@srobroek/opencode-parley)

The question kinds and their option shapes (pick_one, pick_many, confirm, rank,
rate, ask_text, ask_image, ask_file, ask_code, show_diff, show_options,
show_plan as review, thumbs, emoji_react, slider) follow octto 0.4.5
(commit dbbc991), https://github.com/vtemian/octto, src/types.ts. No octto
code is copied; the TUI, the round protocol and the tools are new.

